  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"">Deprecated:  Not implemented.</p>
      <p>  <p>The integer constant STATUS_CAST_SHADOWS has the value 0x200</p>
  <p>This status flag would set an object&#39;s ability to cast <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Lighting_and_shadows" target="_blank">shadows</a>.</p>
  <p>There is no client support for this feature. [[1]](#footnote_1)</p>
</p>
    </div>

